   },
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "“I hope to hold my own concert to introduce more people to Chinese "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "folk",
      "ref": "v-folk"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " music,” said Zheng Xiaohui, a Chinese student in Milan, Italy. In 2023, her wish came true."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "In May, Zheng and her classmate Ma Ruomeng gave an "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "open-air",
      "ref": "v-open-air"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " concert in a Milan park. Zheng played the erhu, and Ma played the pipa. About 100 people came to listen."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "They played several pieces, including the well-known Italian song "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Bella Ciao"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". “The audience was surprised,” Zheng recalled. “They never thought a Chinese "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "instrument",
      "ref": "v-instrument"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " could play their local music so beautifully.”"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Zheng first thought of performing in the street after watching online videos of street musicians. Inspired by a violinist in Rome, she decided to try playing the erhu in public."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Since then, she has received flowers and drawings from listeners. Once, while performing "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Bella Ciao"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " in front of the "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "Milan Cathedral",
      "zh": "米兰大教堂"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", a crowd gathered and "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "applauded",
      "ref": "v-applaud"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". An older man began to dance, and soon a younger woman joined in. “It showed me that music has no "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "boundaries",
      "ref": "v-boundary"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ",” Zheng said."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p6",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Besides traditional Chinese music, Zheng also plays Western pop, jazz, and rock on the erhu. Her schoolmate Ye Peng suggested she share videos online. “Like a "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "dandelion",
      "zh": "蒲公英"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " seed spreading in the wind, Zheng is bringing erhu music to more places in the world,” Ye said."
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
